{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Noun===
[[File:Illu bladder.jpg|thumb|right|The urinary bladder.]]
{{en-noun|head=[[urinary]] [[bladder]]}}

# {{anatomy}} An elastic, muscular sac situated in the pelvic cavity, into which [[urine]] from the [[kidney]]s is stored prior to disposal by [[urination]]. Urine enters the bladder via the [[ureter]]s and exits via the [[urethra]].

====Synonyms====
* [[bladder]]
* [[cystis urinaria]]
* [[vesica]]
* [[vesica urinaria]]
* [[urocyst]]
* [[urocystis]]

